  detect changes in aging processes over short timescales have potential to
  function as surrogate endpoints for intervention effects on healthy
  lifespan38,49. The methods proposed to quantify biological aging [...]``}
  \qitem{f}{``The purpose of DNAm analysis in CALERIE was to evaluate
